<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<catalogue xmlns="http://www.battlescribe.net/schema/catalogueSchema" id="opr36-dg-catalogue" name="Dwarf Guilds" revision="1" battleScribeVersion="2.03" library="false" gameSystemId="b174-c09d-3660-f001" gameSystemRevision="5"><sharedRules><rule id="opr36-dg-00001" name="Sturdy" hidden="false"><description>If most models in this unit have this rule, they get +1 to Defense rolls when shot/charged from over 9&quot;/6&quot; away.</description></rule><rule id="opr36-dg-00002" name="Enhanced Guarded" hidden="false"><description>If most models in this unit have Guarded, they always get +1 to Defense rolls from Guarded (instead of only when shot/charged from over 9&quot;/6&quot; away).</description></rule><rule id="opr36-dg-00003" name="Enhanced Sturdy" hidden="false"><description>If most models in this unit have Sturdy, they always get +1 to Defense rolls from Sturdy (instead of only when shot/charged from over 9&quot;/6&quot; away).</description></rule><rule id="opr36-dg-00004" name="Fortified" hidden="false"><description>When units where most models have this rule take hits, those hits count as having AP(-1), to a min. of AP(0).</description></rule><rule id="opr36-dg-00005" name="Guarded" hidden="false"><description>If most models in this unit have this rule, they get +1 to Defense rolls when shot/charged from over 9&quot;/6&quot; away.</description></rule><rule id="opr36-dg-00006" name="Infiltrate" hidden="false"><description>Counts as having Ambush, but may be deployed anywhere over 3&quot; away from enemy unit.</description></rule><rule id="opr36-dg-00007" name="Melee Slayer" hidden="false"><description>When charging, this model's weapons get AP(+2) if most models in the target have Tough(3) or higher.</description></rule><rule id="opr36-dg-00008" name="Mend" hidden="false"><description>Once per activation, before attacking, pick one friendly model within 3&quot; with Tough, and remove D3 wounds from it.</description></rule><rule id="opr36-dg-00009" name="Precision Frenzy" hidden="false"><description>Place one token on this unit when it fully destroys an enemy unit, up to a max. of two tokens. For each token all models with this rule in this unit get +1 to hit rolls until the end of the game.</description></rule><rule id="opr36-dg-0000a" name="Scourge" hidden="false"><description>For each unmodified result of 1 to block hits, enemies count as having taken 2 extra wounds when checking who won melee, or if shooting wounds would trigger Morale Tests.</description></rule><rule id="opr36-dg-0000b" name="Speed Debuff" hidden="false"><description>Once per activation, before attacking, Stealt pick one enemy model within 18&quot; in line of sight, which moves -2&quot; when using Advance actions and -4&quot; when using Rush/Charge actions once (next time the effect would apply).</description></rule><rule id="opr36-dg-0000c" name="Swift" hidden="false"><description>This model may ignore the Slow rule.</description></rule><rule id="opr36-dg-0000d" name="Unique Hero" hidden="false"><description>Counts as having Hero, and this model may only be taken once per army.</description></rule><rule id="opr36-dg-0000e" name="Unpredictable" hidden="false"><description>When attacking, roll one die and apply one effect to all models with this rule: on a 1-3 they get AP(+1) on their weapons, and on a 4-6 they get +1 to hit rolls instead.</description></rule><rule id="opr36-dg-0000f" name="Unpredictable Fighter" hidden="false"><description>When in melee, roll one die and apply one effect to all models with this rule: on a 1-3 they get AP(+1) on their weapons, and on a 4-6 they get +1 to hit rolls instead.</description></rule><rule id="opr36-dg-0000g" name="Unwieldy" hidden="false"><description>Strikes last when charging.</description></rule><rule id="opr36-dg-0000h" name="Anti-Cover when Shooting Aura" hidden="false"><description>This model and its unit get Anti-Cover on its weapons when shooting.</description></rule><rule id="opr36-dg-0000i" name="Enhanced Sturdy Aura" hidden="false"><description>This model and its unit get Enhanced Sturdy.</description></rule><rule id="opr36-dg-0000j" name="Increased Shooting Range Aura" hidden="false"><description>This model and its unit get +6&quot; range on its weapons when shooting.</description></rule><rule id="opr36-dg-0000k" name="Infiltrate Aura" hidden="false"><description>This model and its unit get Infiltrate.</description></rule><rule id="opr36-dg-0000l" name="Regeneration Aura" hidden="false"><description>This model and its unit get Regeneration. h Aura: This model and its unit get Stealth.</description></rule><rule id="opr36-dg-0000m" name="Swift Aura" hidden="false"><description>This model and its unit get Swift.</description></rule><rule id="opr36-dg-0000n" name="Unpredictable Fighter Aura" hidden="false"><description>This model and its unit get Unpredictable Fighter.</description></rule><rule id="opr36-dg-0000o" name="Deceleration Rune (1)" hidden="false"><description>Pick one enemy unit within 18&quot; in line of sight, which moves -2&quot; when using Advance actions and -4&quot; when using Rush/Charge actions once (next time the effect would apply).</description></rule><rule id="opr36-dg-0000p" name="Cleaving Rune (1)" hidden="false"><description>Pick one enemy unit within 18&quot; in line of sight, which takes 1 hit with Blast(3).</description></rule><rule id="opr36-dg-0000q" name="Battle Rune (2)" hidden="false"><description>Pick up to two friendly units within 12&quot;, which get +6&quot; range on its weapons when shooting once (next time the effect would apply).</description></rule><rule id="opr36-dg-0000r" name="Smiting Rune (2)" hidden="false"><description>Pick one enemy unit within 12&quot; in line of sight, which takes 4 hits with Scourge.</description></rule><rule id="opr36-dg-0000s" name="Armor Rune (3)" hidden="false"><description>Pick up to three friendly units within 18&quot;, which get Enhanced Sturdy once (next time the effect would apply).</description></rule><rule id="opr36-dg-0000t" name="Breaking Rune (3)" hidden="false"><description>Pick one enemy model within 24&quot; in line of sight, which takes 3 hits with AP(4). This effect is resolved as if the target was a unit of [1].</description></rule><rule id="opr36-dg-0000u" name="Stealth Aura" hidden="false"><description>This model and its unit get Stealth.</description></rule><rule id="opr36-dg-0001k" name="Anti-Cover" hidden="false"><description>When attacking with this weapon, ignore the target's cover protection.</description></rule><rule id="opr36-dg-002a3" name="Armor(2)" hidden="false"><description>While the item granting this rule is equipped, this model uses Defense 2+.</description></rule></sharedRules><selectionEntries><selectionEntry id="opr-spellcat-dg-entry" name="Spell Catalogue" type="upgrade" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true"><categoryLinks><categoryLink id="opr36-dg-002pu" name="Spell Catalogue" targetId="opr-spell-catalogue-category" primary="true" hidden="false"/></categoryLinks><infoLinks><infoLink id="opr36-dg-002pv" name="Deceleration Rune (1)" targetId="opr36-dg-0000o" type="rule" hidden="false"/><infoLink id="opr36-dg-002pw" name="Cleaving Rune (1)" targetId="opr36-dg-0000p" type="rule" hidden="false"/><infoLink id="opr36-dg-002px" name="Battle Rune (2)" targetId="opr36-dg-0000q" type="rule" hidden="false"/><infoLink id="opr36-dg-002py" name="Smiting Rune (2)" targetId="opr36-dg-0000r" type="rule" hidden="false"/><infoLink id="opr36-dg-002pz" name="Armor Rune (3)" targetId="opr36-dg-0000s" type="rule" hidden="false"/><infoLink id="opr36-dg-002q0" name="Breaking Rune (3)" targetId="opr36-dg-0000t" type="rule" hidden="false"/></infoLinks><constraints><constraint id="opr36-dg-002q1" type="min" value="1" field="selections" scope="force" shared="true"/><constraint id="opr36-dg-002q2" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="force" shared="true"/></constraints></selectionEntry><selectionEntry id="opr36-dg-0002k" name